---
---

<section class="hero">
  <div class="container hero-inner">
    <div class="badge">
      <span class="dot"></span>
      Fully Deterministic · Verifiable · Reproducible
    </div>

    <h1>
      Turn AI into a <span>proof-backed system</span>
    </h1>

    <p class="lead">
      Determinisma Komputado makes every inference reproducible, auditable, and
      independently verifiable. Same input, same output — always. No hidden
      randomness, no black-box decisions, no trust required.
    </p>

    <div class="cta-row">
      <a href="#how" class="btn btn-primary">Explore the approach</a>
      <a href="#verify" class="btn btn-ghost">How verification works →</a>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-meta" aria-label="Key product metrics">
      <div class="metric">
        <strong>10,000+</strong>
        <span>trace checks</span>
      </div>
      <div class="metric">
        <strong>99.99%</strong>
        <span>replay fidelity</span>
      </div>
      <div class="metric">
        <strong>0</strong>
        <span>trusted black boxes</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="trust-strip" aria-label="Core guarantees">
      <span>Deterministic runtime</span>
      <span>Cryptographic trace</span>
      <span>Independent verification</span>
      <span>Audit-ready output</span>
    </div>

    <div class="terminal" aria-label="Determinism verification terminal demo">
      <div class="terminal-bar">
        <span class="term-dot red"></span>
        <span class="term-dot yellow"></span>
        <span class="term-dot green"></span>
        <span class="term-label">determinisma verify</span>
      </div>
      <pre><code><span class="c-dim">$</span> determinisma run --input prompt.json --seed 0
<span class="c-green">✓</span> inference complete — hash: <span class="c-accent">a3f7c2e1…</span>
<span class="c-green">✓</span> deterministic: <span class="c-green">true</span>
<span class="c-green">✓</span> reproducible across 10,000 runs
<span class="c-dim">$</span> determinisma verify --hash a3f7c2e1…
<span class="c-green">✓</span> output verified — matches committed trace</code></pre>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero {
    position: relative;
    padding: 88px 0 72px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .hero::before,
  .hero::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: auto;
    border-radius: 50%;
    filter: blur(70px);
    opacity: 0.25;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .hero::before {
    width: 420px;
    height: 420px;
    left: -80px;
    top: 26px;
    background: rgba(105, 168, 255, 0.28);
  }

  .hero::after {
    width: 460px;
    height: 460px;
    right: -100px;
    top: 40px;
    background: rgba(79, 227, 161, 0.18);
  }

  .hero-inner {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    text-align: center;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 8px 18px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
    background: rgba(16, 23, 37, 0.8);
    color: var(--text-dim);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px rgba(105, 168, 255, 0.08);
  }

  .dot {
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--green);
    box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(79, 227, 161, 0.9);
  }

  h1 {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
    font-size: clamp(2.7rem, 7vw, 5rem);
    font-weight: 850;
    line-height: 0.98;
    letter-spacing: -0.06em;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  h1 span {
    display: inline-block;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e7f1ff 0%, var(--accent) 44%, #8de1ff 100%);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    background-clip: text;
    color: transparent;
  }

  .lead {
    max-width: 720px;
    font-size: 1.14rem;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }

  .cta-row {
    display: flex;
    gap: 16px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-bottom: 42px;
  }

  .btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 14px 28px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.96rem;
    transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease, background 0.2s ease;
  }

  .btn:hover {
    text-decoration: none;
    transform: translateY(-1px);
  }

  .btn-primary {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent) 0%, var(--accent-strong) 100%);
    color: #fff;
    box-shadow: 0 16px 28px rgba(61, 126, 246, 0.34);
  }

  .btn-primary:hover {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #7bb5ff 0%, var(--accent-strong) 100%);
  }

  .btn-ghost {
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    background: rgba(17, 25, 40, 0.55);
    color: var(--text-dim);
  }

  .btn-ghost:hover {
    border-color: var(--border-strong);
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .hero-meta {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(120px, 1fr));
    gap: 18px;
    width: min(620px, 100%);
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .metric {
    padding: 18px 12px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 14px;
    background: rgba(18, 29, 51, 0.52);
    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(2, 6, 15, 0.18);
  }

  .metric strong {
    display: block;
    font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 2vw, 1.55rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    margin-bottom: 2px;
  }

  .metric span {
    color: var(--text-dim);
    font-size: 0.76rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  .trust-strip {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 10px;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }

  .trust-strip span {
    padding: 7px 12px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: rgba(15, 22, 36, 0.7);
    color: var(--text-dim);
    font-size: 0.73rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .terminal {
    width: min(720px, 100%);
    background: rgba(5, 9, 17, 0.9);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 16px;
    overflow: hidden;
    text-align: left;
    box-shadow: 0 24px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.38);
  }

  .terminal-bar {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 7px;
    padding: 12px 14px;
    background: rgba(12, 17, 27, 0.95);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .term-dot {
    width: 11px;
    height: 11px;
    border-radius: 50%;
  }

  .term-dot.red { background: #ff5f57; }
  .term-dot.yellow { background: #febc2e; }
  .term-dot.green { background: #28c840; }

  .term-label {
    margin-left: auto;
    font-size: 0.76rem;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    font-family: "SF Mono", "Fira Code", monospace;
  }

  pre {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 18px 20px 20px;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.9;
    overflow-x: auto;
    color: #dfeafe;
  }

  code {
    font-family: "SF Mono", "Fira Code", "Cascadia Code", monospace;
  }

  .c-dim { color: #6f86b8; }
  .c-green { color: #59d79d; }
  .c-accent { color: #7bb5ff; }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .hero {
      padding-top: 72px;
    }

    .lead {
      font-size: 1.03rem;
    }

    .hero-meta {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      width: 100%;
    }

    .cta-row {
      width: 100%;
    }

    .btn {
      width: 100%;
    }
  }
</style>
